# Wave W17-W (Route 211): lotus turf — bluff-top turf, still-air flecks: a calm warm bluff green carrying sparse straw flecks and the rarest pale petal flecks, the meditation bluff’s stillness kept in the sward (design: the LOTUSFIST meditation circle on its own bluff; the road ends at the mountain and the mountain is not an ending). Route 211’s own ground — split from Route 208’s warm rest meadow beside it by the petal flecks and the stillness (the bluff meditates, the rest road merely rests) and from Route 207’s glinting climb turf by register entire: no rings ring here, only petals settle.
